                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-400 px-1">
                        <span>Click any chat message timestamp below to jump the voice player to that moment.</span>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <button type="button" onclick="seekAudioRelative(-10)"
                                    class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 font-mono">
